                    <h2 class="h1 heading-light text-colour1 mb-3">TERMS AND CONDITIONS</h2>
                    <h2 class="h4 heading-semibold mb-3">NIC ASIA REWARD PROGRAM (NIC EXPRESS REWARD)</h2>
                    <p class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular">The following terms and conditions apply to the NIC ASIA Rewards Program (<strong>the “Program”</strong>) and will continue on an ongoing basis unless terminated in accordance with item 9 below.</p>
                    <p class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular">By participating in the Program you will be deemed to have read, understood and accepted these Terms and Conditions.</p>
                    <ol>
                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">Definitions
                            <ol class="mt-3" type="a">
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">“NIC ASIA”, “Us”, “We” or “Our” means NIC ASIA BANK LIMITED;</li>
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">“Reward” means physical or other items or services offered against redemption of the required NIC EXPRESS REWARD as will be notified by NIC ASIA from time to time;</li>
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">“Reward Points” or “NIC EXPRESS REWARD” means points earned and accumulated as provided in item 3 below;</li>
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">“USSD” means Unstructured Supplementary Service Data, a protocol used by GSM mobile phones to communicate with their service provider's computers via text messages;</li>
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">“Website” means the portal www.NICASIAgroup.com or such web address as may be designated by NIC ASIA from time to time</li>
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">“You” or “Participant” means a NIC ASIA Customer who has enrolled to participate in the Program as provided in item 2.2 below;</li>
                            </ol>
                        </li>
                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">Participation
                            <ol class="mt-3" style="list-style: none;">
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">2.1 Eligibility
                                     <ol class="mt-3" style="list-style: none;">
                                         <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">2.1.1 The Program is offered at the sole discretion of NIC ASIA and is open to personal / individual NIC ASIA customers who choose to enrol on the Program as provided in item 2.2 below but will exclude corporate / Business customers and any other category of customers as NIC ASIA may communicate from time to time.</li>
                                         <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">2.1.2 The Program is available to individuals for their personal use only, subject to the provisions of these Terms and Conditions, and is limited to one participation per Customer, regardless of the number of bank accounts held with us.</li>
                                         <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">2.1.3 Employees of NIC ASIA and individuals employed by our business partners or vendors are eligible for membership for personal use only but may be excluded from certain benefits of the Program at the discretion of NIC ASIA.</li>
                                         <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">2.1.4 By joining the Program and becoming a Participant, you agree that you have read, understood and agree to be bound by these Program Terms and Conditions of Participation (“Program Terms”) and by any changes or modifications we may make. You should review these Program Terms frequently to understand the terms and conditions that apply to the Program as they may change from time to time. These Program Terms do not alter in any way the terms or conditions of any other agreement you may have with us, including any agreement for banking products or services.</li>
                                         <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">2.1.5 By enrolling in the Program, you also agree to be bound by our website Privacy Policy and our website Terms and Conditions, which are incorporated herein by reference. If you do not agree to these Program Terms, our website Privacy Policy, and our website Terms and Conditions, you cannot participate in the Program.</li>
                                         <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">2.1.6 The Program is valid in LOCATION only.</li>
                                     </ol>
                                </li>
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">2.2 Enrolment Procedure
                                     <ol class="mt-3" style="list-style: none;">
                                         <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">2.2.1	In order to become a Participant, you will be required to enrol on the Program via the available channels below:
                                             <ol class="mt-3" type="A">
                                                 <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">Branch Enrolment
                                                     <ul class="mt-3">
                                                         <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">If you are an existing account holder, fill in the amendment form or account opening forms provided at the NIC ASIA Branch and tick the Loyalty Program box.</li>
                                                         <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">If you are opening a new account, tick the Loyalty Program Box, when filling in the application form for Mobile / Internet Banking.</li>
                                                     </ul>
                                                 </li>
                                                 <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">Mobile Phone (Mobi)
                                                    <ul class="mt-3">
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Dial *111#</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Enter Mobi PIN</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Go to My Account</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Select NIC EXPRESS REWARD</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Select Enrol</li>
                                                    </ul>
                                                     <p class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular">You will receive a confirmation SMS for enrolment</p>
                                                 </li>
                                                 <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">NIC ASIA Application (NIC ASIA App)
                                                    <ul class="mt-3">
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Download the NIC ASIA App from Google or Apple Stores</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Click on the Menu Bar on the left hand side of the screen</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Click on the NIC EXPRESS REWARD Menu</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Click on Enrol</li>
                                                    </ul>
                                                     <p class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular">You will receive a confirmation SMS for enrolment</p>
                                                 </li>
                                             </ol>
                                         </li>
                                         <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">2.2.2 Enrolment to the Program will be free and you will only be deemed to have been enrolled and become a Participant in the Program once you receive a confirmation SMS to that effect from NIC ASIA.</li>
                                         <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">2.2.3 Only one Program account may be associated with a NIC ASIA customer and a single mobile phone number. In the event of a dispute over ownership of the Program membership account, the participant will be deemed to be the authorized account holder of the NIC ASIA account submitted at the time of enrollment. For purposes of these Program Terms, the "authorised account holder" is the natural person who is assigned to the submitted Bank account.</li>
                                         <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">2.2.4	Warranties Given by the Participant
                                             <p class="h6 my-3 heading-regular">In addition to complying with the provisions of these Terms and Conditions, you warrant to NIC ASIA that:</p>
                                             <ol class="mt-3" type="a">
                                                 <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">The information given by you at the time of account opening is complete, true and accurate and that you will inform NIC ASIA of any subsequent changes to such particulars.</li>
                                                 <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">You will not sell barter or attempt to assign, transfer or deal with the NIC EXPRESS REWARD accrued otherwise than as authorized by these Terms and Conditions.</li>
                                                 <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">You will give to NIC ASIA such information as may be requested at NIC ASIA’s discretion in order to verify your entitlements under the Program or for any other purpose whatsoever.</li>
                                                 <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">You will not act in a manner likely to affect the good name of NIC ASIA.</li>
                                                 <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">You own or are authorised to use all NIC ASIA accounts against whose usage NIC EXPRESS REWARD will accrue.</li>
                                                 <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">You consent to NIC ASIA sharing your information as per clause 6 below.</li>
                                             </ol>
                                         </li>
                                     </ol>
                                </li>
                            </ol>
                        </li>
                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">NIC EXPRESS REWARD
                            <p class="h6 my-3 heading-regular">Once you are confirmed as a Participant in the Program, you may earn NIC EXPRESS REWARD, as provided below, when you transact using various of the Bank’s channels. Once you earn a certain number of points, you may be eligible to redeem benefits and rewards applicable to that number of points, which benefits may change from time to time and may be offered on a limited basis.</p>
                            <ol style="list-style: none;">
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">3.1	Earning NIC EXPRESS REWARD
                                   <ul class="mt-3">
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">3.1.1 <strong>Activities that will earn you NIC EXPRESS REWARD:</strong> See attached Annex.</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">3.1.2 NIC ASIA will not allocate NIC EXPRESS REWARD and may reverse or cancel any NIC EXPRESS REWARD allocated where it is found that such NIC EXPRESS REWARD were accrued in breach of these Terms and Conditions or otherwise incorrectly.</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">3.1.3 As a Bank account holder, you will not be eligible to redeem your NIC EXPRESS REWARD if any of your NIC ASIA account(s) has a zero (0) balance, is dormant, inactive or is overdrawn.</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">3.1.4 You will immediately FORFEIT all accrued NIC EXPRESS REWARD if:
                                           <ol class="mt-3" style="list-style: none;">
                                               <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">3.1.4.1 any facility extended to you by the Bank becomes overdue, and you may begin to accumulate points once your account with the Bank is regularised; or </li>
                                               <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">3.1.4.2 if you close your account; or</li>
                                               <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">3.1.4.3 Your participation is terminated under clause 11.3</li>
                                           </ol>
                                       </li>
                                   </ul>
                                    <p class="h6 my-3 heading-regular">For the avoidance of doubt if your account is active, check your balance as provided in 3.2 below</p>
                                </li>
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">3.2	Checking Your NIC EXPRESS REWARD Balance
                                    <ol class="mt-3" style="list-style: none">
                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">3.2.1  You may check the number of NIC EXPRESS REWARD accrued using the following methods:
                                            <ol class="mt-3" style="list-style: none">
                                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">3.2.1.1  By Mobile phone USSD Code:
                                                    <ul class="mt-3">
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Dial *522# on your mobile phone</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Enter Mobi PIN</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Go to My Account</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Select NIC EXPRESS REWARD</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Select Balance Enquiry</li>
                                                    </ul>
                                                </li>
                                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">3.2.1.2  Using the NIC ASIA App:
                                                    <ul class="mt-3">
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Download the NIC ASIA Bank App from Google or Apple Stores</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Click on the Menu Bar on the left hand side of the screen</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Click on the NIC EXPRESS REWARD Menu</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Your balance will display on the screen</li>
                                                    </ul>
                                                </li>
                                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">3.2.1.3  Through the NIC EXPRESS REWARD Online Portal
                                                    <ul class="mt-3">
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Visit WEBISTE NAME</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Log in to the portal with your mobile phone number and Password</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Click on My Account</li>
                                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Check Account Summary</li>
                                                    </ul>
                                                </li>
                                            </ol>
                                        </li>

                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">3.1.4 You will immediately FORFEIT all accrued NIC EXPRESS REWARD if:
                                            <ol class="mt-3" style="list-style: none;">
                                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">3.1.4.1 any facility extended to you by the Bank becomes overdue, and you may begin to accumulate points once your account with the Bank is regularised; or </li>
                                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">3.1.4.2 if you close your account; or</li>
                                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">3.1.4.3 Your participation is terminated under clause 11.3</li>
                                            </ol>
                                        </li>
                                    </ol>
                                </li>
