                        </li>
                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">Redemption of NIC EXPRESS REWARD
                            <ol class="mt-3" style="list-style: none;">
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">4.1	Available Rewards and how to redeem your NIC EXPRESS REWARD
                                   <ul class="mt-3">
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">4.1.1	You will be able to redeem your NIC EXPRESS REWARD for NIC ASIA products and services, Merchandise and such other rewards as NIC ASIA may offer from time to time (“Rewards”).</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">4.1.2	Information regarding the available Rewards and the applicable redemption requirements will be communicated by NIC ASIA in the press, NIC ASIA website or any other means determined by NIC ASIA from time to time.</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">4.1.3	To redeem Rewards, you must have accumulated the minimum number of points as established by us for a particular benefit.</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">4.1.4	Rewards can only be redeemed through USSD by dialing *111#, Select My Account, NIC EXPRESS REWARD and redeem. By using the NIC ASIA App, and clicking NIC EXPRESS REWARD on the main menu, or by logging into the NIC EXPRESS REWARD website WEBISTE NAME</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">4.1.5	If you have concerns that a purchase, redemption or other activity was not properly applied to your Participation in the Program, you should contact NIC ASIA Customer Service at 0711 087000 or 0732 187000.</li>
                                   </ul>
                                </li>
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">4.2	What else you need to know about the redemption of your NIC EXPRESS REWARD
                                    <ol class="mt-3" type="a">
                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Once you have successfully redeemed your points as described above, such request cannot be revoked, amended or exchanged for another reward nor will the redeemed points be reinstated to you.</li>
                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Merchandise displayed from time to time and featured at the NIC ASIA website (BANK WEBISTE NAME) is subject to availability. The receipt by NIC ASIA of an intention to redeem such items will not constitute a reservation nor purchase of that item.</li>
                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">NIC ASIA reserves the right, at its absolute discretion to set any quota for, or replace or withdraw any featured Reward at any time and to substitute any Reward requested for redemption by a Participant for a different Reward of comparable point value to the particular Reward requested by the Participant.</li>
                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">NIC ASIA reserves the right to change any of the Program Rewards, how you accrue NIC EXPRESS REWARD, and how we evaluate and reward your eligible Program activity. We reserve the right to place limits on the number or types of activities that are eligible for the Program, in a given time period or for the duration of the Program, and/or any combination thereof.</li>
                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">The redeemers of all Merchandise will be required to identify themselves through the presentation of such documentation as shall be considered suitable for verification by NIC ASIA including but not limited to any of the following forms of identification: original Identification Card/original Passport.</li>
                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">By redeeming NIC EXPRESS REWARD you release NIC ASIA from any and all liability regarding the redemption of the NIC EXPRESS REWARD.</li>
                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Redeemed Rewards cannot be exchanged or returned for replacement NIC EXPRESS REWARD, another product, or a monetary refund</li>
                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">NIC ASIA is not responsible or liable for any redemption of your NIC EXPRESS REWARD balance where the redemption was not authorized by you, or due to any fraudulent activity by you or any third party.</li>
                                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">If you have concerns that a redemption of or other activity was not properly applied to your Participation in the Program, you should contact NIC ASIA Customer Service at</li>
                                    </ol>
                                </li>
                            </ol>
                        </li>
                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">Expiration of Your NIC EXPRESS REWARD
                            <ol class="mt-3" style="list-style: none;">
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">5.1	NIC EXPRESS REWARD accrued will be deemed to have expired:
                                   <ul class="mt-3">
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">5.1.1	36 months after they have been accrued (<strong>Validity Period</strong>) at the end of the quarter immediately following the end of the Validity Period or as communicated to you by NIC ASIA;</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">5.1.2	Immediately, in the event that a Participant’s NIC ASIA Bank account has been inactive or has been closed in accordance with NIC ASIA’s applicable terms and conditions.</li>
                                   </ul>
                                </li>
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">5.2	Upon termination of the Program as provided in item 9.2 below you will be required to
	                                redeem your NIC EXPRESS REWARD within Two (2) months from the date on which NIC ASIA publishes a
	                                notice of termination. Points not redeemed within this period will be deemed to have expired
	                                and thereby forfeited by the Participant.
                                </li>
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">5.3	NIC ASIA will not be obligated to offer an extension or reinstatement of expired or
	                                forfeited points nor offer any cash refunds or other exchanges or compensation whatsoever
	                                for expired or forfeited NIC EXPRESS REWARD.
                                </li>
                            </ol>
                        </li>
                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">Use of Personal Data
                            <p class="h6 my-3 heading-regular">NIC ASIA will use and be entitled to disclose the personal information you provide for the following purposes:</p>
                            <ol class="mt-3" type="a">
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Administering the Program.</li>
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Fraud prevention and law enforcement.</li>
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Marketing and research related activities.</li>
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Such other purposes as may be provided in the terms and conditions of use of any of the NIC ASIA products and services.</li>
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Compliance with any legal requirements or court order.</li>
                            </ol>
                        </li>
                        <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">Transfer of NIC EXPRESS REWARD
                            <ol class="mt-3" style="list-style: none;">
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">7.1 General Terms for Transfer of NIC EXPRESS REWARD:
                                   <ol class="mt-3" type="a">
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">You must have a minimum of 50 NIC EXPRESS REWARD to perform a transfer.</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">There is no maximum number of Points that you can transfer.</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Transfer of NIC EXPRESS REWARD is not limited to any multiples; both even and odd figures will be processed.</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">NIC ASIA will not charge any service fee on the transfer transactions.</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Service will be unavailable to customers whose accounts are locked due to breach of this terms and conditions and will be reinstated only when the account is regularised.</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">NIC EXPRESS REWARD can only be transferred to and Participants</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">There is no limit to the number of times that you can transfer your NIC EXPRESS REWARD</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">NIC EXPRESS REWARD once transferred will not be reversed.</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">NIC ASIA will act on all requests from you for transfer of NIC EXPRESS REWARD.</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">NIC ASIA will not be liable for any claims or allegations of irregular or fraudulent requests for transfer of NIC EXPRESS REWARD.</li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">It is your sole responsibility to keep your POINTS Passwords secure. NIC ASIA will not be liable for any claims or allegations of irregular requests for transfer of NIC EXPRESS REWARD.</li>
                                   </ol>
                                </li>
                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-semibold text-colour7 mx-3">How to Transfer your NIC EXPRESS REWARD
                                   <ol class="mt-3" type="a">
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">
                                           To transfer NIC EXPRESS REWARD through our USSD service, you will follow the prompts below:
                                           <ul class="mt-3">
                                               <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Dial *111# and enter your MobiPIN;</li>
                                               <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Select the sub menu My Account, NIC EXPRESS REWARD” and then</li>
                                               <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Select Transfer Points</li>
                                               <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Enter the recipients Mobile Number;</li>
                                               <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Enter the number of NIC EXPRESS REWARD intended to be transferred o Click “OK” to confirm</li>
                                           </ul>
                                           <p class="h6 my-3 heading-regular">You will receive a message informing you of the status of the transfer</p>
                                       </li>
                                       <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">
                                           To transfer NIC EXPRESS REWARD through our NIC ASIA App you may follow the steps below:
                                           <ul class="mt-3">
                                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Download the NIC ASIA Bank App from Google or Apple Stores</li>
                                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Click on the Menu Bar on the left hand side of the screen</li>
                                                <li class="h6 mb-3 heading-regular text-colour7 mx-3">Click on the NIC EXPRESS REWARD Menu</li>
